  "name": "bcknd",
  "description": "A Rust workspace architecture investigating the decoupling of service orchestration from web delivery through a modular multi-crate design. The project implements a structural separation between a dedicated supervisor and a web server, facilitating research into process lifecycle management and service isolation. It serves as an experimental foundation for prototyping scalable, systems-level backend infrastructures using idiomatic Rust patterns.",
